{"2276810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JunkTok: Paranormal Investigators Challenge", "steam_appid": 2276810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5050400], "detailed_description": "<h1>RainbowOS 6</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Underwood presents RainbowOS 6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/dfe98273b53f9ecf0961efa6229bf390.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Underwood ecosystem is now more connected than ever with the revolutionary new RainbowOS 6.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JunkTok now features <strong>MiniApps</strong> and <strong>EyeAI</strong>, bringing even more capabilities into the Underwood ecosystem.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/0529451d26820c5ace4280fc85c1dc6f.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Settings (ESC)</strong> — lets you customize everything to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Camera (R)</strong> — enables the selfie camera alongside the main camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Microphone (V)</strong> — lets you communicate with your teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashlight (F)</strong> — lets you switch between Wide and Focused flashlight modes. This feature is available on RainbowPhone 5, RainbowPhone 5S, RainbowPhone 6, and RainbowPhone 6S. It is unavailable on earlier RainbowPhone models and devices from other manufacturers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard (T)</strong> — lets you type messages in UnderwoodMessage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/2968c77f4039872764e28baa307c5825.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Filters (1)</strong> — lets you choose from 10 different filters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music (2)</strong> — lets you listen to today’s five most popular tracks on JunkTok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masks (3)</strong> — lets you use a variety of AR face masks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EyeAI (4)</strong> — lets you scan everything around you, including creatures, slime, and portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MiniApps (5)</strong> — lets you purchase and download essential Underwood apps, including EMFPulse, RawWatch, Radar, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/19bd7206bc87bc1a85bf5885d2fad633.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing Context Window — a revolutionary new way to see what matters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Information. Where you need it. When you need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The RainbowOS 6 Context Window lets you switch between pages and access more detailed information about everything happening during your live stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/6efb222dca30cd54a4975af36cea2f1e.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tab 1 — Comments</strong> — shows how viewers are reacting to the stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tab 2 — Stats</strong> — shows the streamer’s personal statistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tab 3 — State</strong> — provides a comprehensive overview of the JunkToker and their surroundings, including the streamer’s food preferences, strikes, the current color of the sky, completed tasks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some things are better discovered for yourself. Explore RainbowOS 6 and see why it remains the standard by which every operating system is measured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>© 1967–2016 Underwood, Inc. All rights reserved.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/56c39c1f20bb08e3e0f7dcee2e911e8c.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE CHALLENGE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five nights await you — Monday through Friday. Each night, you and your friends will collect data for EyeAI. It’s easier than it sounds: scan Creatures, their Slime, and the Portals they came through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the instructions, and no one will get hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROBABLY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/1e2ff8ffb6ebded533a0c43b63f28b79.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPLETING YOUR EYEAI ASSIGNMENT ISN’T ENOUGH.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To claim the <strong>€100,000 prize</strong>, your team must take the #1 spot in the viewer rankings. Every night, teams that fail to attract enough viewers will be cut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you grow your audience? Easy: complete donation requests, see how chat reacts, and don’t forget to smile 🙂</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU’RE LIVE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/cb72b2087a36f22c5c50b0b924b7e18f.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY RUN. A NEW BUILD.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a character with a unique ability, start each run with a random perk, and unlock new upgrades as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine effects, adapt on the fly, and put together a build that can carry you through all five nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUSH PAST YOUR LIMITS. BECOME THE ULTIMATE JUNKTOKER.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/f670a763e1375c896f2068da3e5d0fc4.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THOUGHT THAT WAS EVERYTHING?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here’s just a small sample of what else can affect your run:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sky effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >air quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >zodiac signs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mini-apps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >masks and filters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >disabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dancing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >surveillance cameras</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AND MUCH, MUCH MORE.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/56c39c1f20bb08e3e0f7dcee2e911e8c.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE CHALLENGE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five nights await you — Monday through Friday. Each night, you and your friends will collect data for EyeAI. It’s easier than it sounds: scan Creatures, their Slime, and the Portals they came through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the instructions, and no one will get hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROBABLY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/1e2ff8ffb6ebded533a0c43b63f28b79.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPLETING YOUR EYEAI ASSIGNMENT ISN’T ENOUGH.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To claim the <strong>€100,000 prize</strong>, your team must take the #1 spot in the viewer rankings. Every night, teams that fail to attract enough viewers will be cut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you grow your audience? Easy: complete donation requests, see how chat reacts, and don’t forget to smile 🙂</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU’RE LIVE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/cb72b2087a36f22c5c50b0b924b7e18f.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY RUN. A NEW BUILD.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a character with a unique ability, start each run with a random perk, and unlock new upgrades as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine effects, adapt on the fly, and put together a build that can carry you through all five nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUSH PAST YOUR LIMITS. BECOME THE ULTIMATE JUNKTOKER.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/extras/f670a763e1375c896f2068da3e5d0fc4.avif?t=1788192782\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THOUGHT THAT WAS EVERYTHING?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here’s just a small sample of what else can affect your run:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sky effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >air quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >zodiac signs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mini-apps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >masks and filters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >disabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dancing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >surveillance cameras</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AND MUCH, MUCH MORE.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A challenge for one to three participants. Survive five nights, craft your build, and scan Creatures with EyeAI. Reach #1 to claim €100,000 and become a JunkTok legend!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Turkish, Japanese, Hungarian, Danish, Dutch, Norwegian, Romanian, Finnish, Czech, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/f151d3ce61bdfee3eda37f08b86aa5ca0830436f/header.jpg?t=1788192782", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/341a2ede3005d9a71cc6a9dbaf616bd820ea1768/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788192782", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276810/341a2ede3005d9a71cc6a9dbaf616bd820ea1768/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788192782", "